  "limits": "Emission lights the scene only in renderers that treat emissive meshes as lights (Cycles does, with noise); EEVEE needs light probes or extra lamps. No bloom: add glare in the compositor. The white core is a stylized ramp, not a gas discharge spectrum. Rendered here with Cycles CPU only. Verified in Blender 5.2.1; written for the 4.2 API.",
